re development 4) Experience with Linux administration, GitLab CI/CD Ansible, Jenkins experience 5) Fluent English 6) Experience with correct git & pull request workflow 7) Being a proactive and responsible team player 8) Experience working within Agile/Scrum framework Great to have : 1) Experience with Retool 2) Experience with Linux, SSH, Nginx 3) Experience with Unit testing, code refactoring & review 4) Recent experience as a tech lead 5) Experience with Chat API 6) Experience with ML and NLP
