n to other options such as Pinecone or Weaviate depending on if they can meet the functionality requirements. 4. Beta Usage Site Preparation - Test all implemented features and address any issues found - Set up a beta usage site for a limited number of users to collect feedback To apply, please submit your resume, a brief introduction explaining your experience with similar projects, and a link to your GitHub profile or other relevant work samples. We're excited to review your application and get this project going! Don't worry about getting the application perfect. Freelancers can send questions in their proposals, and we can connect later to discuss details.
